{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bashing Brutal is a fully Physics-Based combat game, focusing on melee fighting. Experience the Brutal life of a Gladiator, Bash your opponent's heads in with Maces, Boxing Gloves, Baseball Bats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600350/extras/SatisfyingCombat.gif?t=1749473659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are fighting in a Gladiator Arena, Boxing Ring, MMA Octagon, or on The Streets, your impacts will be Felt!<br>Satisfying physics-based hit reactions and Gore. Blood, Blood everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600350/extras/Full_Physics_Immersion3.gif?t=1749473659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters and Combat aren't the only things that use physics. Everything in the Environment uses cutting edge physics simulation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600350?t=1749473659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600350?t=1749473659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600350/99ae13727affc29173c4c18ac8eb52808d8ed8f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749473659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600350/99ae13727affc29173c4c18ac8eb52808d8ed8f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749473659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id